IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-ATTENTION-OFFLOAD.

DATA DIVISION.
01 TOTAL-TOKENS        PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 VRAM-CAPACITY-TOKENS PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 PINNED-TOKENS       PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 OFFLOADED-TOKENS    PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.
01 HIT-RATE-PCT        PIC 9(9) USAGE R4.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-ATTN-OFFLOAD.
    IF TOTAL-TOKENS == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    IF TOTAL-TOKENS < VRAM-CAPACITY-TOKENS
        MOVE TOTAL-TOKENS TO PINNED-TOKENS.
        MOVE 0 TO OFFLOADED-TOKENS.
    ELSE
        MOVE VRAM-CAPACITY-TOKENS TO PINNED-TOKENS.
        COMPUTE OFFLOADED-TOKENS = TOTAL-TOKENS - VRAM-CAPACITY-TOKENS.
    END-IF.

    COMPUTE HIT-RATE-PCT = (PINNED-TOKENS * 100) / TOTAL-TOKENS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 PINNED-TOKENS.
    WEIGHT 30 OFFLOADED-TOKENS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 10.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
